ext":[{"move":"d1c1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5d1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f1e3","comment":" 一之不足，再弃一子，击中红方要害，红方实在是吞咽不得，否则炮5进5绝杀。黑方手段果然厉害，生擒一车初战告捷。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d1c1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2h1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7e3","comment":" 红虽能得回一车，但黑炮5进4巧妙，可一车换双，还是净赚一子。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c1c0","comment":" 红不甘无为而负，舍车吃炮，力求一战，黑趁势吃底相，顺手牵羊，为迅速入局创造了条件。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h1h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4d6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d6e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b0","comment":" 黑胜。\r\n 短评：此局黑方虽是后手行棋，却一直保持着进攻态势，这一点十分重要。中局阶段巧妙构思，大胆进击，终以见缝插针的着法克敌制胜，其因势利导，别出心裁的跟踪追车的绝妙手法，赞叹之余，亦感到由衷的敬佩。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}}